  "document": "Søren Rasted\nSøren Nystrøm Rasted (born Søren Rasted on 13 June 1969 in Blovstrød, Denmark) is a Danish musician, singer, songwriter and record producer. He plays keyboard, guitar and sings backing vocals. He is one of the four members of Danish eurodance group Aqua, and was married to the Aqua vocalist Lene Nystrøm."
